WEBVTT

00:00:05.191 --> 00:00:11.191
Choose Help centre in the side menu.

00:00:11.571 --> 00:00:16.939
Type "roles" in the Search
the help centre box.

00:00:17.189 --> 00:00:20.740
Click Search.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:25.386
